# Deny by default: only the portable files un-ignored below are tracked.
# Anything new (a new secret file, a new cache) stays out automatically.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!agent
agent/*
!agent/AGENTS.md
!agent/settings.json
!agent/extensions
agent/extensions/*
!agent/extensions/guardrails.json
!agent/extensions/auto-model
!agent/extensions/auto-model/**

# Everything below is credentials, chat history, or machine-generated state.
# Keep these lines even though they are redundant with the deny-all above:
# they document what must stay private and survive future rule changes.
**/auth.json
**/secrets/
**/trust.json
**/models-store.json
**/sessions/
**/*.log
**/node_modules/
agent/install/
agent/npm/
